# Title: PUA - CleanWipe Execution
# ID: f44800ac-38ec-471f-936e-3fa7d9c53100
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-12-18
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects the use of CleanWipe a tool usually used to delete Symantec antivirus.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*\\SepRemovalToolNative_x64.exe) OR (process.executable:*\\CATClean.exe AND process.command_line:*--uninstall*) OR (process.executable:*\\NetInstaller.exe AND process.command_line:*-r*) OR (process.executable:*\\WFPUnins.exe AND (process.command_line:*/uninstall* AND process.command_line:*/enterprise*)))
